WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.649 --> 00:00:05.839
Casey Bloys: Based on George R.R. Martin's
book Fire &amp; Blood.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.250
This new show takes place 300 years before
Game of Thrones.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:12.530
It tells the story of House Targaryen in the
earlier days of Westeros.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:16.900
I don't want to give away too much but what
I will tell you is that House of the Dragon

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.380
is co-created
and executive produced by George and Ryan

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.180
Condal and also executive produced
and directed by Miguel Sapochnik.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:28.369
Miguel, of course, is one of the most masterful
Game of Thrones directors.

00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:32.290
He won an Emmy for the unforgettable episode
Battle of the Bastards.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.400
We couldn't be happier to have found the next
great chapter in George's saga

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.950
and we wanted this news to bring our content
presentation to a close.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:48.270
Thank you all very much for your time today.

